    "description": "NCR 7812-5XXX series scanner/scale (where XXX denotes alternative approved models), Class III, mains operated, self-indicating, weight only, Non-Automatic Weighing Instrument. Designed for flush-mounting in checkout surface, having frame extensions to support the instrument in the checkout counter. Intended to be installed in a fixed position in checkout and self-checkout counters, consequently a levelling device and level indicator are not provided. Stainless steel load receptor; pole-mounted display. Devices: initial zero setting device, semi-automatic zero setting device, zero tracking device, automatic zero setting device, zero indicator, gravity compensation. Interfaces: Main power adapt, IBM 485, USB/USB power, RS232, Display, Scanner, ICL MDL (Interlock). Equipped with an integrated single character seven segment display, also used to provide audit trail information from the two event counters."
